# two ids on one path, and a manifest, a disk and approvals that agree
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
registry and manifest aligned (2 skills)
skills/ on disk matches overlay.manifest (1 files)
global skill approvals verified (2 skills: 2 approved, 0 grandfathered)
--- stderr ---
note: the skills "alpha" and "beta" share the path "alpha"

# three ids on one path, in the order the registry says them
